      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1935932264359112941",
      "text": "[6:23AM] #FunshoWilliamsAve #TrafficUpdate \n\nFrom Dorman-long  bridge inwards Ojuelegba has good movement, Dorman-long bridge inwards  Ojuelegba bridge is still a good one, Ojuelegba bridge inwards Baracks has better movement,  Baracks inwards Stadium bridge is very good this morning,  Stadium under bridge has slow movement approaching the traffic light, Stadium bridge inwards Alaka is very good to go, Alaka on the service lane is very good, Alaka inwards Iponri has better movement, Costain inwards Eko bridge is very good. \nReturn journey from Eko bridge, Alaka, Stadium both main carriage way and on the service lane is still good to go, Baracks on the main carriage way, Ojuelegba inwards Dorman-long bridge is good.",
